:: StoryTitle
Silk Thread

:: StorySubtitle [nobr]
<<if $currentRelease === 2>>Release 2 &middot; The Mistake<<else>>Release 1 &middot; The Ordinary Life<</if>>

:: Start [system]
<<set $currentRelease = 1>>
<div class="title-screen">
    <div class="title-image">
        <img src="files/images/ui/title_card.png" alt="Silk Thread"
             onload="this.closest('.title-screen').classList.add('has-title-image')"
             onerror="this.closest('.title-image').classList.add('is-missing')">
    </div>
    <div class="title-text-fallback">
        <p class="title-wordmark">SILK&nbsp;THREAD</p>
        <div class="title-rule"></div>
        <p class="title-subtitle">Release One &middot; The Ordinary Life</p>
    </div>

    <div class="title-menu">
        <<link "Begin" "R1_Opening">><</link>>
        <<link "Settings" "Settings">><</link>>
        <<link "Credits" "Credits">><</link>>
    </div>

    <p class="title-footer">A literary interactive fiction &middot; 18+</p>
</div>

:: Settings [system nobr]
<div class="title-screen">
    <p class="title-wordmark" style="font-size:2rem;">Settings</p>
    <div class="title-rule"></div>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-ui); color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:0.85rem; max-width:360px; margin-bottom:2rem;">
        Use the menu in the left sidebar to manage saves. Text size and other display preferences follow your browser's defaults.
    </p>
    <div class="title-menu">
        <<link "Back" "Start">><</link>>
    </div>
</div>

:: Credits [system nobr]
<div class="title-screen">
    <p class="title-wordmark" style="font-size:2rem;">Credits</p>
    <div class="title-rule"></div>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-ui); color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:0.85rem; max-width:360px; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
        Silk Thread - Release 1: The Ordinary Life
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-ui); color:var(--text-dim); font-size:0.75rem; max-width:360px; margin-bottom:2rem;">
        Written in the literary minimalist tradition. Built in Twine / SugarCube.
    </p>
    <div class="title-menu">
        <<link "Back" "Start">><</link>>
    </div>
</div>
